#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:7
#: 2a24660009cd407d9eb8480caab0898b 5c1e2fb306884b3195711450f3b3bfcd
#: 64470061827a4edfb01f57b43faef973 75a2ce883d7e44aea6dc5af845ea8975
#: 777b5b9706bc4afca35ce5b55863bd8c
msgid "Brushless PWM Gimbal"
msgstr "无刷PWM云台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:9
#: 5a72bf196d53477bad337a6e44b4a97a 60be6617292e4196afecb791786d434a
#: 6e1d25721c9c407c8af6ed151a9044db 9f573a59bc614576b80321dfae0870fe
#: c0b9d4c42d34486794ead87afdaff9a0
msgid ""
"Many camera gimbals can accept PWM input or SBUS input for controlling the "
"roll, pitch and yaw angles.  This page describes the setup procedure to "
"allow ArduPilot to control these gimbals."
msgstr "许多相机云台可接受PWM输入或SBUS输入来控制横滚、俯仰和偏航角度。本页介绍允许ArduPilot控制这些云台的设置流程。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:16
#: 2c69547425174974aac9d5878ec85ad2 303c6a7a632a4cca872c069a273c7ccb
#: 40096849ff4e4e7dafb062c7491d3a48 5d4df7452a394ae2b06b0a4e03311797
#: e211f593a0914113a2f3bfb583f3a2e0
msgid ""
"These instructions are for ArduPilot 4.3 (and higher).  For ArduPilot 4.2 "
"(and lower) please refer to the :ref:`Servo Gimbal <common-camera-gimbal>` "
"instructions."
msgstr ""
"本说明适用于ArduPilot 4.3（及更高版本）。ArduPilot 4.2（及更低版本）请参阅 :ref:`舵机云台 <common-"
"camera-gimbal>` 说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:19
#: 192fb13adc8a4c769c63d44f8110fb95 1fda24af592d4890afeca3feb09550f2
#: 5cfec319238944e484ccb4ff5a3e9281 69ef19ce9d1740f7b692150d91f6ecbb
#: 6a85b15dd6724aeea8262597a80ca081
msgid "Supported Gimbals"
msgstr "支持的云台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:21
#: 01821a745c45443894ba9ebe66825285 1071b82640d6480d9433e5813a163f36
#: 505570b5de044895bf3b714d68fbf9fa 71d12b84e19c42abb0f9cc620560d0c1
#: c545edc825614c498cf675a8a2b3c480
msgid ""
"Gimbals that accept PWM input or SBUS input to control the gimbal's *lean "
"angle* should work."
msgstr "接受PWM输入或SBUS输入来控制云台*倾斜角度*的云台均应兼容。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:23
#: 569afb7af3074563b8a49e005ec0f66e 81fb7e69e1d6463cb5aa89a3379fb3d2
#: a2be7a2d3ef14165a7bbda90d4f225dd b8849fa4fce04b22a3cbb8014cfbd631
#: f1616714dc9a4277b5db8bc0f1bd3c59
msgid ""
"Some gimbals accept PWM or SBUS input but only provide *rate* control.  "
"These gimbals will not work by default but it may be possible, using the "
"gimbal's configuration application, to configure them to interpret the input"
" for angle control."
msgstr "部分云台接受PWM或SBUS输入，但仅提供*速率*控制。这些云台默认情况下不兼容，但可能通过云台配置应用将其配置为角度控制模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:25
#: 085acf976f0845278b3f87d1ad3d3b72 123d6d7cf2274101a7060a9ed256509d
#: 491f42c5d02f4b79926ecf0a2900b191 b872c1ae386e4613bb2f305124b4a1e7
#: d30c36e1833d484da899f44449e71b19
msgid ""
"The list of supported gimbals is a work-in-progress.  If you would like to "
"add a gimbal that is known to work, please `raise an issue "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_wiki/issues>`__"
msgstr ""
"支持的云台列表持续更新中。若您希望添加已知可用的云台，请 `提交issue "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_wiki/issues>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:28
#: 25d8691fa41c44348b5f54da860b90ce 35f8a9f5b98f4f6aa28080c4a3403deb
#: 69410b68cc4048ffa7275332dc3d1cb3 b1d322c7982447c98796a57dbd6d0481
#: fff76d04383348d99fb0bc11e59d91c8
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接至飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:34
#: 3aceac20deb543da8cacaa70ec8f9945 420d2b110bd24cf1afa3d7543a5618f4
#: 565186cf93ab4c0fadfbda122555d0cb 98b51c3a278842b6b5087213baeaefa3
#: b5666f570c6d477899bb35fb1d78e8e8
msgid ""
"If the gimbal has multiple PWM input ports (one for each axis), connect them"
" to the autopilot PWM output channels. If the gimbal accepts SBUS input then"
" connect it to the autopilot's SBUSo (aka \"SBus output\") port."
msgstr ""
"若云台有多个PWM输入接口（每个轴一个），将其连接至飞控的PWM输出通道。若云台接受SBUS输入，则将其连接至飞控的SBUSo（即「SBUS输出」）接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:37
#: 4012e520441d40db9b4f7b82bcbf7523 70322bf3b83c48c2b5f75be489fe7331
#: 71cd0e38fceb482dbbd408bda650f443 a20b87350bf9410b941e417e4037353b
#: d049e53fa7fc493b8437a84d98038141
msgid ""
"Connect to the autopilot with a ground station and set the following "
"parameters.  These settings assume the autopilot's PWM outputs 9, 10 and 11 "
"will control the gimbal's roll, pitch and yaw angles respectively.  They "
"also assume common angular ranges of the gimbal which may need adjusting to "
"match the actual gimbal being used."
msgstr ""
"通过地面站连接飞控并设置以下参数。这些设置假设飞控的PWM输出9、10和11分别控制云台的横滚、俯仰和偏航角度，同时假设了云台的常用角度范围，可能需要根据实际使用的云台进行调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:39
#: 3bf97373016c45ca8c61c2771419c491 b5772ed3e35f403a855d4b53bc9dec25
#: b963523264ea4d00a9ca75a7913c23c5 e49d663523b74cf38ccd8e4146f876e1
#: ed9f3545a60f4cb199c5ed4a3ff8d2b0
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_TYPE <MNT1_TYPE>` to 7 (BrushlessPWM) and reboot the autopilot"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_TYPE <MNT1_TYPE>` 设置为7（BrushlessPWM），然后重启飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:40
#: 3ebd1b1e3806490bbc40bb47c445adfb 7e994af9de8643949f8d7998b5c9e8d7
#: 8f692973ac5445469219c5182241cad3 90123a02324246c1ba0278bec14ce14c
#: f7ec451618474bfbbbbe952d3c4975c1
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MIN <MNT1_PITCH_MIN>` to -90 (meaning the gimbal can pitch "
"straight downwards)"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MIN <MNT1_PITCH_MIN>` 设为 -90（表示云台可俯仰至正下方）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:41
#: 6cb7b50c129349b29c260f1cb3f05572 72fa06f6631c4a9a85e3c0f4a5250964
#: c2f2ac5034394471b1962ce16667ac8c c52e1d1cc22b41cc94f2ed567016fe67
#: f1ab592f775d40928d04e48df1581828
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MAX <MNT1_PITCH_MAX>` to 25 (meaning the gimbal can pitch "
"up by 25 deg)"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MAX <MNT1_PITCH_MAX>` 设为 25（表示云台可向上俯仰 25 度）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:42
#: 0994ee07cc794a628dd4f7991b664a5d 4984b832e890405299af6263f23df8d7
#: 4c910f8d0e7a43489618b3860d38449d 84dc64b1345f407fb334639703e1bfac
#: bd59c92624f546c38dacc76000209184
