":ref:`MNT1_ROLL_MIN <MNT1_ROLL_MIN>` to -30 (meaning the gimbal can roll "
"right 30 deg)"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_ROLL_MIN <MNT1_ROLL_MIN>` 设为 -30（表示云台可向右横滚 30 度）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:43
#: 03a8c932c6af43c0b912788249cefe78 0b070d40229d446dbe4dea354e0a4d7f
#: 72c3676944884601a1bca87aa6dc533d 986ed60e434144cc9092a203d3002ce7
#: e2fec5b70b3c4fac97481bb558943270
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_ROLL_MAX <MNT1_ROLL_MAX>` to 30 (meaning the gimbal can roll left"
" 30 deg)"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_ROLL_MAX <MNT1_ROLL_MAX>` 设为 30（表示云台可向左横滚 30 度）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:44
#: 05971ad730ba405aa146f6742e6aa309 5406a2e1be12487ab1017b53da4ef381
#: b6083e4feb094fc3b07ef134a480ae9b be0992801d454ab99234ca492e82c712
#: dca872cd3369444692268deaf508f5bb
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_YAW_MIN <MNT1_YAW_MIN>` to -180 (meaning the gimbal can yaw to "
"the left 180deg)"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_YAW_MIN <MNT1_YAW_MIN>` 设为 -180（表示云台可向左偏航 180 度）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:45
#: 15dba449a1a44e1caa84bd437db70fa0 3bda3d6d2ade456791be82c39b0a8f6b
#: 69d600d341b54dda91893bf2508fb3e5 a6a2cc6e6d1e4d7088f1a873d8af4cee
