msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_YAW_MAX <MNT1_YAW_MAX>` 设为 180（表示云台可向右偏航 180 度）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:46
#: 87b1adb58e1e4a75ac68c4bf7e64893f
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_RC_RATE <MNT1_RC_RATE>` to 90 (deg/s) to control speed of gimbal "
"when using RC targetting"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_RC_RATE <MNT1_RC_RATE>` 设为 90（度/秒），用于控制使用 RC 瞄准时云台的转动速度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:47
#: 4ec1d84a0250416b8a26df6f69f0e1a3 5b77e80649a645f084ac50dd6e1cf5c3
#: 8568204a50294a8fb7d619e683d6d5bf 95f3e90cc9104f5b979dbfea5f402948
#: b8d0e5c137164eb1ad9d1ee474d9567d
msgid ":ref:`SERVO9_FUNCTION <SERVO9_FUNCTION>` to 8 (Mount1 Roll)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO9_FUNCTION <SERVO9_FUNCTION>` 设为 8（Mount1 Roll）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:48
#: 195f132670e648c78fc1e08d2f6a879f 1e944c945f7e4d519b330a828a97505e
#: 7932f39fbe0245c2ada6196654ea2ae4 7eb5cadf27664db0922ddd8fec8ac7c0
#: e4f854f8a4284602ae4e9c689add59da
msgid ":ref:`SERVO10_FUNCTION <SERVO10_FUNCTION>` to 7 (Mount1 Pitch)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO10_FUNCTION <SERVO10_FUNCTION>` 设为 7（Mount1 Pitch）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:49
#: 7d569d5f0c29478da6ee057376fb3533 8ab28914b04241869f2cea6727747742
#: c7596d8c03004cc6bb8954ba8a0ef8cc c9420ab056734834b448a7c5ed45638a
#: f1400b7404fb4d2fbdce741046190e56
msgid ":ref:`SERVO11_FUNCTION <SERVO11_FUNCTION>` to 6 (Mount1 Yaw)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO11_FUNCTION <SERVO11_FUNCTION>` 设为 6（Mount1 Yaw）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:50
#: 36d761798dbe4f42829a929cba344dd1
msgid ""
":ref:`RC6_OPTION <RC6_OPTION>` = 213 (\"Mount Pitch\") to control the "
"gimbal's pitch rate with RC channel 6"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RC6_OPTION <RC6_OPTION>` = 213（「Mount Pitch」），通过 RC 通道 6 控制云台俯仰速率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:51
#: 4118a7cc8382472d8336467e6e47d4e1
msgid ""
":ref:`RC7_OPTION <RC7_OPTION>` = 214 (\"Mount Yaw\") to control the gimbal's"
" yaw rate with RC channel 7"
msgstr ":ref:`RC7_OPTION <RC7_OPTION>` = 214（「Mount Yaw」），通过 RC 通道 7 控制云台偏航速率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:52
#: 24ebf672032449aa844cf1337f8b55b6
msgid ""
":ref:`RC8_OPTION <RC8_OPTION>` = 163 (\"Mount Lock\") to switch between "
"\"lock\" and \"follow\" mode with RC channel 8"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RC8_OPTION <RC8_OPTION>` = 163（\"Mount Lock\"），用 RC 通道 8 "
"在\"锁定\"与\"跟随\"模式间切换"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-pwm-gimbal.rst:54
#: 626b462689634768b59c83fab491ae19
msgid ""
"See the \"Control with an RC transmitter\" section of :ref:`this page "
"<common-mount-targeting>` for more details on parameter changes required to "
"control the gimbal through an RC Transmitter (aka \"RC Targeting\")"
msgstr ""
"有关通过RC遥控器控制云台所需参数更改的详细信息，请参阅 :ref:`此页面 <common-mount-targeting>` "
"的「使用RC遥控器控制」章节。"

